# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build (D-101). Everything Git ignores, every
# .env file among it, stays on the PC, and so do the folders the image does not need (the phone
# app alone is about 80 MB). .dockerignore then decides what the image may read.
# Check before a deploy: gcloud meta list-files-for-upload
#!include:.gitignore
.gcloudignore
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.dev-tools/
.dev-phone/
.expo/
.idea/
.vscode/
apps/mobile/
data/
docs/
*.docx
*.md
apps/api/test/
